# Pinned Tailwind v4 standalone CLI: the single source of truth for the version
# and for the SHA-256 of every release asset the build may download (DEV-6727).
#
# Consumers, both of which fail closed on a mismatch:
#   - `_tailwind-bin` in the justfile, behind every `just css*` recipe and both
#     CI build actions
#   - modules/mosaic/playground/Dockerfile
#
# To bump: `just tailwind-pins-refresh <version>` rewrites this file from the
# sha256sums.txt published with that release. Review the diff as you would any
# other dependency bump; that review is what the pin is worth.
#
# Hash lines are `<sha256>  <release asset name>`, the sha256sum(1) format.

